<h3>Some plants to be found on the Meadows</h3>
Some plants to be found on the Meadows are illustrated <a href="Trees/Plants of the Meadows &amp; Bruntsfield Links.pdf" target="_blank"> here.</a>
<h3>Some photographs of trees on the Meadows and Bruntsfield Links</h3>
These were taken in June 2007 by Max Coleman of the Royal Botanic Garden, Edinburgh. Click on picture to get a bigger version (opens in new tab).<br><br>
